，五結翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"相，悉亮翻。服虔曰：啮桑，翟地。徐广曰：在梁与彭城之间。裴骃曰：晋地。索隐曰：衞地。余按汉武帝瓠子歌曰：「啮桑浮兮淮、泗满。」及塞决河而梁、楚之地复宁，无水灾。后汉王梁击佼彊、苏茂于楚、沛间，拔大梁、啮桑，则徐说为近之。啮，五结翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"8c451b01-db0e-11ef-8fde-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"相","official_note":"相是战国时期诸侯国的最高行政长官，负责辅佐君主处理政务。在《资治通鉴》此段中，齐、楚之相参与会盟，表明他们是代表国家的外交使节，体现了相在政治和外交中的重要作用。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"齊、楚之相","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"55ad5f0d-f74d-43c8-80a1-2d8519af178d"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-373,"link_death_year":-310,"link_td_description":"张仪，姬姓，张氏，魏国安邑（今山西夏县）人，战国时期著名的纵横家。提倡连横，即秦国联合其他诸侯国中的几个，然后对抗其他的诸侯国，多次破坏了公孙衍的合纵，为秦惠王重用，封武信君，卒于魏国。","link_td_id":"Q10002172","link_td_number_id":133753,"people_name":"張儀","people_name_jianti_auto":"张仪","people_xingming":"张仪","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8c451b1d-db0e-11ef-9f17-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","resolved_place_entity_id":18,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c451b1e-db0e-11ef-8c22-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","resolved_place_entity_id":25,"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8c451b1f-db0e-11ef-9ce5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","resolved_place_entity_id":130,"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8c451b20-db0e-11ef-b65f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齧桑","place_name_jianti_auto":"啮桑","place_note":"江蘇沛縣西南","resolved_place_entity_id":5587,"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8c451b21-db0e-11ef-9a87-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十四、徐州（卷二十九）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"汉武帝《瓠子歌》：啮桑浮兮淮泗满。及塞决口，而梁、楚无水...","context_before":"啮桑亭[在县西南。徐广曰：梁与彭城间有啮桑。谓此地也。","source_end_index":52,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"18afb555-2c9a-5155-ad10-944e6a3ce351","source_start_index":27,"source_text":"战国周显王四十六年，秦张仪及齐、楚之相，会于啮桑。"}],"path":"南直方舆纪要/十四、徐州（卷二十九）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["外交"],"content":"1秦張儀及齊、楚之相會齧桑。","content_fanyi":"秦国张仪与齐国、楚国的相在啮桑会盟。","content_jianti_auto":"1秦张仪及齐、楚之相会啮桑。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":212,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c451b00-db0e-11ef-97e3-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"趙武靈王","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵武灵王","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c451b24-db0e-11ef-9989-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"趙武靈王之不肯稱王，非守君臣之分，居之以謙也，將求其所大欲而力未能稱心也。處，昌呂翻。令，力丁翻，使也；又力正翻，命令也。分，扶問翻。稱，尺證翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"赵武灵王之不肯称王，非守君臣之分，居之以谦也，将求其所大欲而力未能称心也。处，昌吕翻。令，力丁翻，使也；又力正翻，命令也。分，扶问翻。称，尺证翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"8c451b23-db0e-11ef-a5cb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-356,"link_death_year":-295,"link_td_description":"赵武灵王，嬴姓，赵氏，名雍，中国战国中后期赵国的君主。死后谥号武灵。","link_td_id":"Q10000536","link_td_number_id":193810,"people_name":"趙武靈王","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵武灵王","people_xingming":"雍","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"8c451b25-db0e-11ef-9de8-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[雍]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"韓","place_name_jianti_auto":"韩","place_note":"府新郑，河南新郑","resolved_place_entity_id":301,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c451b26-db0e-11ef-a5fb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"燕","place_name_jianti_auto":"燕","place_note":"府蓟城，北京","resolved_place_entity_id":69,"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8c451b27-db0e-11ef-a5e8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"2韓、燕皆稱王。趙武靈王獨不肯，曰：「無其實，敢處其名乎？」令國人謂己曰君。","content_fanyi":"韩国、燕国都称王了。只有赵武灵王不愿意称王，他说：“没有称王的实力，怎敢接受王的名号呢？”命令国内的人称自己为君。","content_jianti_auto":"2韩、燕皆称王。赵武灵王独不肯，曰：「无其实，敢处其名乎？」令国人谓己曰君。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":213,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c451b22-db0e-11ef-89fe-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"四十六年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"四十六年","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"8c451afe-db0e-11ef-a294-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（戊戌、前三二三）","year_int":-323},"message":"success","success":true}